{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1110233-i-am-also-a-we-supernatural-merit-idea","id":1110233,"title":"I Am Also A We [Supernatural Merit Idea]","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-07-01T09:45:53-07:00","id":1110233,"title":"I Am Also A We [Supernatural Merit Idea]","content":"Anyone who watched Netflix's Sense8 would've probably understood the reference in the topic's title. I thought about a supernatural merit inspired by this show, here it goes:<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><i>I Am Also A We (\u2022 to \u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022)</i></span><br /> <br /> <i>Effect:</i> Your character is a Sensate. She is telepathically and sympathetically connected with a number of other Sensates (represented by the number of dots purchased for this merit) a group of Sensates constitutes a cluster, and members of a cluster can connect with each other wherever they are in the world. This connection grants Sensates three main abilities. These abilities are visiting, sharing and their psychic link.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><i>Psychic Link</i></span><br /> <br /> Sensates within a cluster are mentally and emotionally connected. At first, It starts out as sensory input, where one sensate hears or tastes (or uses any of the other five senses) something another sensate is hearing or tasting the same thing simultaneously. Gradually, their link strengthens to the point where they feel each other's thoughts and emotions (at times even memories)<span style=\"font-size:14px\">. </span>To activate Psychic Link, spend a point of Willpower and roll Wits + Empathy, a success would allow one member of a cluster to experience what another member is experiencing through any or all of the five senses.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><i>Visiting</i></span><br /> <br /> Visiting happens when sensates mentally communicate with each other. Sensates are seemingly mentally transported to each others' locations. Visiting is done instinctively with the other members of one's cluster, especially when they are in need of help. But visiting can also be done with other sensates outside of the cluster. This is only after physical firsthand, eye-to-eye contact has been made.<br /> <br /> Visiting often works hand-in-hand with a sensate's psychic link; Utilizing both, sensates can access any of the five senses through a fellow sensate, allowing them to perceive the world around them through another sensate's eyes. This also includes physical contact, such as with one another. It is not possible to visit a sensate when they are heavily drugged or unconscious, but it appears visiting is possible when the sensate is asleep. To activate Visiting, spend a point of Willpower and roll Wits + Empathy, a success would allow one member of a cluster to visit another successfully.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><i>Sharing</i></span><br /> <br /> Sharing is when a sensate accesses the knowledge, languages and skills of another sensate. Sharing is only done inside the cluster. In the case of skills, sharing allows a sensate to physically control a fellow sensate as the other one watches. To activate Sharing, spend a point of Willpower and roll Wits + Empathy, for every success, a sensate gains a single dot of one of a fellow cluster member's Skills (Attributes cannot be shared)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12561,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12561-shawarbaaz","user":"Shawarbaaz","date":". 07-01-2017, 05:26 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12561-shawarbaaz","name":"Shawarbaaz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12561_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"467"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-01T22:24:15-07:00","id":1110471,"title":"","content":"Hmm. I wonder if you might also be able to fit in some &quot;distributed computing&quot; abilities in here for psychic Supernatural Merits, similar to how <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1051456-even-more-legacies-updated-to-2e?p=1109045#post1109045\">Cloud Infinite</a> operates.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-02T08:17:30-07:00","id":1110550,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1110233-i-am-also-a-we-supernatural-merit-idea?p=1110471#post1110471\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hmm. I wonder if you might also be able to fit in some &quot;distributed computing&quot; abilities in here for psychic Supernatural Merits, similar to how <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1051456-even-more-legacies-updated-to-2e?p=1109045#post1109045\">Cloud Infinite</a> operates.</div> </div> </div> </div><b>Distributed Processing (\u2022\u2022)</b><br /> Sensates have been known to be able to access the aggregate mental capacity of their cluster. While this doesn't make them smarter, <i>per se</i>, it can allow them to think faster or more effectively.<br /> <b>Requirements:</b> I Am Also A We \u2022\u2022<br /> <b>Benefit:</b> You can use the Sensate Sharing ability to use a single Mental Merit any of the other Sensates in your Cluster has, provided it has a dot rating no greater than your rating in I Am Also A We.<br /> <b>Drawback:</b> When you use this ability, the rest of the Cluster feels dazed or disoriented. When you use this merit, fellow Insensates in your Cluster suffer the Stunned Tilt, and if a Cluster-mate uses this merit, you suffer the Stunned tilt.<br /> <br /> <b>Psychic Support (\u2022\u2022\u2022)</b><br /> While not terribly common, some Sensates have been known to acquire some kind of psychic potential, or had some before becoming part of their Cluster. Clusters with psychics can often support each other, allowing a Sensate Psychic to push their powers long past when lone mentalists would be exhausted.<br /> <b>Requirements:</b> I Am Also A We \u2022\u2022, Distributed Processing, any Supernatural Merit<br /> <b>Benefit:</b> When a Sensate with this Merit activates a Supernatural or Sensate Merit with a Willpower cost, any other Sensate in the Cluster can choose to pay part or all of that cost in place of them.<br /> <b>Special:</b> If a Sensate has other supernatural abilities (e.g. Wolfblood Tells) with a Willpower cost, the Storyteller may want to allow those abilities to benefit from this Merit as well.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://eoinsstuff.shoutwiki.com/wiki/Genius:_the_Transgression_(2nd_Edition)\" target=\"_blank\">Genius: the Transgression 2E is a thing that's being worked on.</a>","edited":{"userid":4488,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4488-malonkey1","user":"malonkey1","date":". 07-03-2017, 01:34 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4488-malonkey1","name":"malonkey1","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4488_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1620"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-02T14:05:11-07:00","id":1110655,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Shawarbaaz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1110233-i-am-also-a-we-supernatural-merit-idea#post1110233\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><i>Sharing</i></span><br /> <br /> Sharing is when a sensate accesses the knowledge, languages and skills of another sensate. Sharing is only done inside the cluster. In the case of skills, sharing allows a sensate to physically control a fellow sensate as the other one watches. To activate Sharing, spend a point of Willpower and roll Wits + Empathy, for every success, a sensate gains a single dot of one of a fellow cluster member's Skills (Attributes cannot be shared)</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm not sure that Attributes shouldn't be shared. When Capheus is channelling Sun, he certainly seems to be displaying her physical fitness and condition as well as her skills. And in another fight where Wolfgang is channeling her, they briefly switch back to him when being punched in the face, after which we see Sun smirking in a way that implies such a blow hurt less than usual.<br /> <br /> From the same fight as the second example, we also see that in sharing, the channelled sensate isn't 100% limited to their clustermate's body and can project a presence outside it. Specifically, you see Wolfgang and Sun taking on separate thugs too far apart for it to be Wolfgang's body engaging them both - JMS confirmed that this was deliberate. Since we don't see that often - and it's not something Jonas implied was possible - it may be an ability only some clusters have (maybe those with more members).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/321-sunlessnick","name":"SunlessNick","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1214"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-02T14:20:10-07:00","id":1110661,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>SunlessNick</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1110233-i-am-also-a-we-supernatural-merit-idea?p=1110655#post1110655\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm not sure that Attributes shouldn't be shared. When Capheus is channelling Sun, he certainly seems to be displaying her physical fitness and condition as well as her skills. And in another fight where Wolfgang is channeling her, they briefly switch back to him when being punched in the face, after which we see Sun smirking in a way that implies such a blow hurt less than usual.<br /> <br /> From the same fight as the second example, we also see that in sharing, the channelled sensate isn't 100% limited to their clustermate's body and can project a presence outside it. Specifically, you see Wolfgang and Sun taking on separate thugs too far apart for it to be Wolfgang's body engaging them both - JMS confirmed that this was deliberate. Since we don't see that often - and it's not something Jonas implied was possible - it may be an ability only some clusters have (maybe those with more members).</div> </div> </div> </div><b>Communal Power (</b><b>\u2022\u2022\u2022+ or \u2022+)</b><br /> As Clusters grow, they sometimes exhibit a sort of projected influence on things around them when working in concert. At times, they can be frightfully powerful.<br /> <b>Requirements:</b> I Am Also A We \u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022<br /> <b>Benefit:</b> Your Cluster can manifest shared psychic power. Select Supernatural Merits with a total number of dots equal to your the total dots in this Merit held by all members of the Cluster, added together. In any scene where two or more members of your Cluster are together, they may use these Supernatural Merits as if they had them. A lone member of your Cluster can also gain access to these merits for a Scene by spending 1 point of Willpower and rolling Wits + I Am Also A We dots.<br /> <b>Special:</b> This Merit comes in two versions, a 3+ dot version, and a 1+ dot version. As long as at least one member of a given Cluster has the 3+ dot version, any other members can purchase the 1+ dot version, allowing them to contribute to the total number of Communal Power dots in the Cluster.<br /> <br /> &quot;I Am Also a We&quot; is kind of unwieldy as a Merit name. Maybe just call the merit &quot;Sensate&quot;?<br /> <br /> Right, so I'm now realizing that I'm making homebrew for homebrew. So I'll do more here to avoid a double-post:<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> <b>Deep Interface (\u2022\u2022)</b><br /> Your Cluster's bond affects each of you on a deep, psychological level, allowing you to feel each others' emotions to a limited extent.<br /> <b>Requirements:</b> I Am Also A We \u2022<br /> <b>Benefit:</b> When you use your Psychic Link with a fellow member of your Cluster, you also acquire any mental or emotional Conditions they are currently experiencing. If they are under a Persistent Condition, you only gain a non-Persistent Version.<br /> <b>Drawback:</b> This applies to negative Conditions as well as helpful or neutral ones. So if you link up with a Cluster-mate suffering from Deprived, you will also feel Deprived of whatever they're hooked on.<br /> <br /> <b>Silent Speech (\u2022\u2022)</b><br /> Your Cluster is so synced up, you can communicate without needing to speak.<br /> <b>Requirements:</b> I Am Also A We \u2022\u2022\u2022, Deep Interface<br /> <b>Benefit:</b> You can silently communicate simple thoughts with fellow members of your Cluster by using Visiting to impart verbal information instead of sharing a sense. The information you convey can't be highly technical or complicated in nature, but it can be as descriptive as it needs to be, arriving not only as words, but as images, sounds and smells.<br /> <br /> <b>Cluster Master (\u2022\u2022\u2022)</b><br /> Your Cluster tends to trust your leadership, and so they are willing to open their minds to you more fully than they might for other members of the Cluster.<br /> <b>Requirement:</b> I Am Also A We \u2022\u2022, Inspiring<br /> <b>Benefit:</b> When you use the Inspiring Merit on your Cluster, you suffer no penalty, regardless of how big your cluster is, and you can spend 1 Willpower to gain the Rote Quality on the roll.<br /> <br /> <b>Alien Cluster (\u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022)</b><br /> Your cluster has somehow acquired a supernatural member of some kind. Maybe a Mage has hacked themself into your psychic bond, maybe it's formed around a vampire with psychic powers, maybe you are the pack of a werewolf mystic. In any case, your Cluster has a powerful asset.<br /> <b>Requirement:</b> I Am Also A We \u2022\u2022\u2022<br /> <b>Benefit:</b> Your Cluster includes an individual with a template that would otherwise forbid them being a Sensate. They can use the Psychic Link and Visiting, but no other abilities of the Sensate. They may not benefit from nor take dots in Sensate Merits (they can take the 1+ dot Psychic Support without meeting prerequisites, but they can't use its effects), unless they have gained the means to take those merits otherwise. The Psychic Link and Visiting extend to supernatural senses as well as mundane ones.<br /> <b>Drawback</b><b>:</b> In addition to the possible dangers of allowing a monster into your Cluster, you are offered no immunity to any of the monsters' abilities or state of being. You still suffer from the Disquiet your Promethean Cluster-mate, and you can't see through a Demon Cluster-mate's Cover.<br /> <b>Special:</b> No more than one copy of this Merit can exist within a Cluster, but the Cluster can spread the costs of the merit across multiple members, as long as a total of 5 Merit Dots have been spent on the Merit by the Cluster as a whole.<br /> </div></div> </div> </div><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://eoinsstuff.shoutwiki.com/wiki/Genius:_the_Transgression_(2nd_Edition)\" target=\"_blank\">Genius: the Transgression 2E is a thing that's being worked on.</a>","edited":{"userid":4488,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4488-malonkey1","user":"malonkey1","date":". 07-02-2017, 07:32 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4488-malonkey1","name":"malonkey1","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4488_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1620"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-03T06:19:49-07:00","id":1110815,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>malonkey1</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1110233-i-am-also-a-we-supernatural-merit-idea?p=1110550#post1110550\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&quot;I Am Also a We&quot; is kind of unwieldy as a Merit name. Maybe just call the merit &quot;Sensate&quot;?</div> </div> </div> </div>True, I just didn't want to associate the merit too much with the show, plus I Am Also A We sounded much better than simply calling it &quot;Sensate&quot;. Renaming Merits is always an option though.<br /> <br /> Edit: Thanks for expanding on the idea by the way, much appreciated!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12561,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12561-shawarbaaz","user":"Shawarbaaz","date":". 07-03-2017, 09:25 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12561-shawarbaaz","name":"Shawarbaaz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12561_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"467"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-03T11:43:39-07:00","id":1110931,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Shawarbaaz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1110233-i-am-also-a-we-supernatural-merit-idea?p=1110815#post1110815\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> True, I just didn't want to associate the merit too much with the show, plus I Am Also A We sounded much better than simply calling it &amp;quot;Sensate&amp;quot;. Renaming Merits is always an option though.<br /> <br /> Edit: Thanks for expanding on the idea by the way, much appreciated!</div> </div> </div> </div>What about calling the merit &quot;Cluster&quot;?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-03T14:04:42-07:00","id":1110998,"title":"","content":"I think Sensate was mentioned as a media source for Deviant: the Renegade. I am hoping that when that book comes out it will eventually be able to handle this kind of story. If not directly than at least to the extent of Kiznaiver - which is straight up Deviant territory (group of people forcibly experimented on to share physical pain and eventually full empathy)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5118-perverseness","name":"Perverseness","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"57"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}